flowchart LR
    Ingest[Ingestion]
    Classify[Classification & Metadata]
    Store[Versioned Storage]
    Review[Review / Approval]
    Publish[Available for Retrieval]
    Retrieve[Search & Retrieve]
    Archive[Archive / Retain]
    Dispose[Controlled Disposal]

    Ingest --> Classify --> Store --> Review --> Publish --> Retrieve
